  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Int. conference rural dev</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Int. konferens landsbygd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An international conference will be carry out which makes it possible to achieve a national consensus on rural strategy and to create a major forum to present, discuss and review current rural strategies and policies. The decsion will make it possible to finance Swedish experts to assist Latvian counterparts in their future work.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En internationell konferens ska som syftar till att n&#xe5; en nationell konsensus f&#xf6;r en strategi f&#xf6;r landsbygdsutveckling. Konferensen kan utg&#xf6;ra en god plattform f&#xf6;r att presentera, diskutera och f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra nuvarande strategier och policy f&#xf6;r landsbygdsutveckling.Sidas st&#xf6;d utg&#xf6;r finansiering av svenska experter.</narrative>
  </description>
